          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Aaron the priest went up into mount Hor at the commandment of Jehovah, and died there, in the fortieth year after the children of Israel were come out of the land of Egypt, in the fifth month, on the first day of the month. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Aaron was a hundred and twenty and three years old when he died in mount Hor.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the Canaanite, the king of Arad, who dwelt in the South in the land of Canaan, heard of the coming of the children of Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they journeyed from mount Hor, and encamped in Zalmonah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they journeyed from Zalmonah, and encamped in Punon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they journeyed from Punon, and encamped in Oboth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they journeyed from Oboth, and encamped in Iye-abarim, in the border of Moab. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they journeyed from Iyim, and encamped in Dibon-gad. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they journeyed from Dibon-gad, and encamped in Almon-diblathaim. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they journeyed from Almon-diblathaim, and encamped in the mountains of Abarim, before Nebo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they journeyed from the mountains of Abarim, and encamped in the plains of Moab by the Jordan at Jericho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they encamped by the Jordan, from Beth-jeshimoth even unto Abel-shittim in the plains of Moab.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.49"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Jehovah spake unto Moses in the plains of Moab by the Jordan at Jericho, saying, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Speak unto the children of Israel, and say unto them, When ye pass over the Jordan into the land of Canaan, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "then ye shall drive out all the inhabitants of the land from before you, and destroy all their figured ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", and destroy all their molten images, and demolish all their high places: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and ye shall take possession of the land, and dwell therein; for unto you have I given the land to possess it. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And ye shall inherit the land by lot according to your families; to the more ye shall give the more inheritance, and to the fewer thou shalt give the less inheritance: wheresoever the lot falleth to any man, that shall be his; according to the tribes of your fathers shall ye inherit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But if ye will not drive out the inhabitants of the land from before you, then shall those that ye let remain of them be as pricks in your eyes, and as thorns in your sides, and they shall vex you in the land wherein ye dwell. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.55"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "56",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:56"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "56",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And it shall come to pass, that, as I thought to do unto them, so will I do unto you.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.56",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.56"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
